{
  "file": "module6",
  "page": 43,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        73.38239288330078,
        527.4234008789062,
        87.82539367675781
      ],
      "text": "Five prospective cohort studies were identified, with a total of 7769 participants; four were newly",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        87.38239288330078,
        527.4251708984375,
        101.82539367675781
      ],
      "text": "identified. Three of the studies were conducted in South Africa and two in India  . The  (45, 65-68)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        101.38239288330078,
        527.3914184570312,
        115.82539367675781
      ],
      "text": "studies included people living with HIV, pregnant women, adolescents, healthcare workers and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        115.38239288330078,
        527.3792724609375,
        129.8253936767578
      ],
      "text": "household contacts. The pooled risk ratio estimate for TST was 1.49 (95% CI: 0.79–2.80), and that for",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        129.3824005126953,
        527.4521484375,
        143.8253936767578
      ],
      "text": "IGRA was 2.03 (95% CI: 1.18–3.50). Although the estimate for IGRA was slightly higher than that for",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        143.3824005126953,
        527.4310913085938,
        157.8253936767578
      ],
      "text": "TST, the 95% CIs for the estimates for TST and IGRA overlapped and were imprecise. Furthermore,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        157.3824005126953,
        490.9111022949219,
        171.8253936767578
      ],
      "text": "there was limited evidence for the predictive utility of the tests in specific at-risk populations.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        185.3824005126953,
        527.4277954101562,
        199.8253936767578
      ],
      "text": "The evidence reviewed and the recommendations apply only to the use of the two commercially",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        199.3824005126953,
        527.4248046875,
        213.8253936767578
      ],
      "text": "available IGRAs (QuantiFERON -TB Gold In-Tube and T-SPOT .TB). The GDG concluded that the  ® ®",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        213.3824005126953,
        527.4068603515625,
        227.8253936767578
      ],
      "text": "comparison of TST and IGRA in the same population does not provide strong evidence that one",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        227.3824005126953,
        527.4420166015625,
        241.8253936767578
      ],
      "text": "test should be preferred over the other for predicting progression to TB disease. TST may require",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        241.3824005126953,
        524.4158935546875,
        255.8253936767578
      ],
      "text": "significantly fewer resources than IGRA and may be more familiar to practitioners in resource-",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        255.3824005126953,
        527.41455078125,
        269.8254089355469
      ],
      "text": "constrained settings; however, recurrent global shortages and stock-outs of TST reduce prospects",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        269.38238525390625,
        317.8227844238281,
        283.8254089355469
      ],
      "text": "for its scale-up in programmatic management of TPT.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        297.38238525390625,
        527.4486083984375,
        311.8254089355469
      ],
      "text": "The GDG cautioned that imperfect performance of these tests can lead to false-negative results,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        311.38238525390625,
        527.4367065429688,
        325.8254089355469
      ],
      "text": "particularly for young children and immunocompromised individuals such as people living with HIV",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        325.3824157714844,
        527.4218139648438,
        339.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "with low CD4 counts. Although some studies suggest otherwise  , the GDG maintained the  (45, 50)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        339.3824157714844,
        527.42236328125,
        353.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "past position that people living with HIV who have a positive test for TB infection benefit more from",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        353.3824157714844,
        527.4340209960938,
        367.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "TPT than those who have a negative TB infection test  . TB infection testing can be used,  (33, 63)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        367.3824157714844,
        527.3936157226562,
        381.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "where feasible, to identify such individuals. However, based upon evidence of moderate certainty,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        381.3824157714844,
        527.4036254882812,
        395.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "the GDG strongly emphasized that TB infection testing by TST or IGRA should not be a prerequisite",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        395.3824157714844,
        527.3860473632812,
        409.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "to start TPT in people living with HIV and household contacts aged < 5 years, particularly in settings",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        409.3824157714844,
        527.4188842773438,
        423.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "with a high TB incidence (e.g. > 100 TB cases per 100 000 population), given that benefits clearly",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        423.3824157714844,
        527.4222412109375,
        437.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "outweigh the risks. A negative TB infection test in these two groups, as well as in HIV-negative infant",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        437.3824157714844,
        527.416748046875,
        451.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "household contacts, should be followed by a case-by-case assessment for the potential benefit and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        451.3824157714844,
        135.2480010986328,
        465.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "harms of TPT.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        479.2064208984375,
        525.97021484375,
        493.6274108886719
      ],
      "text": "Recommendation 19: Mycobacterium tuberculosis antigen-based skin tests for testing for TB",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiboldItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        493.2064208984375,
        114.0630874633789,
        507.6274108886719
      ],
      "text": "infection",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiboldItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        507.3824462890625,
        527.4398803710938,
        521.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "In 2022, WHO issued recommendations on the use of TBST for the diagnosis of TB infection. To",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        521.3824462890625,
        527.4243774414062,
        535.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "inform these recommendations WHO commissioned a systematic review in 2021 of published",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        535.3824462890625,
        527.441162109375,
        549.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "and unpublished data on this new class of tests for TB infection not previously reviewed by WHO.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        549.3824462890625,
        527.4267578125,
        563.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "The technologies that were included in the evaluation were Cy-Tb (Serum Institute of India, India),",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        563.3824462890625,
        527.3945922851562,
        577.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "Diaskintest  (Generium, Russian Federation) and C-TST (formerly known as ESAT6-CFP10 test, Anhui  ®",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        577.3823852539062,
        527.4234619140625,
        591.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "Zhifei Longcom, China). This more recent class of TB infection tests is defined as in vivo skin tests for",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        591.3823852539062,
        494.076416015625,
        605.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "the detection of TB infection that use  -specific antigens (ESAT-6 and CFP-10).  M. tuberculosis",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        619.3823852539062,
        527.3914184570312,
        633.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "Based on available evidence, in 2022 the WHO GDG panel concluded that the diagnostic accuracy",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        633.3823852539062,
        527.4322509765625,
        647.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "of TBSTs is similar to that of IGRAs and greater than that of the TST. The GDG panel expressed",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        647.3823852539062,
        527.3883056640625,
        661.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "concerns about the certainty (quality) of evidence in many areas and the lack of longitudinal studies",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        661.3823852539062,
        527.4366455078125,
        675.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "that include impact on people affected by important outcomes of TB. The risk of bias was primarily",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        675.3823852539062,
        527.4081420898438,
        689.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "from non-blinded studies, and the quantity and quality of evidence varied among the different tests.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        689.3823852539062,
        527.4166259765625,
        703.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "For two of the three tests evaluated during the GDG meeting (Diaskintest  and C-TST), evidence on  ®",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        703.3823852539062,
        527.42333984375,
        717.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "specificity was generated in high TB burden settings; therefore, additional analysis considered the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        717.3823852539062,
        527.42333984375,
        731.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "concordance in specificity with existing WHO-recommended IGRAs. All three evaluated TBSTs have",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        731.3823852539062,
        527.385986328125,
        745.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "the potential to be used for the detection of TB infection and are recommended. No safety concerns",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        745.3823852539062,
        527.4221801757812,
        759.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "were identified for the class of tests; however, evaluation and approval by the competent regulatory",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        759.3823852539062,
        527.3892211914062,
        773.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "agencies for the individual products are essential before introduction of these in vivo tests. Although",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        329.7992858886719,
        801.2599487304688,
        553.4072875976562,
        811.8897705078125
      ],
      "text": "25 2. ﻿ Reduce the burden of TB among people living with HIV",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    }
  ]
}